            <entry>
              <string>content</string>
              <string>{{layout}}
{{layout-section ac:type="fixed-width" ac:breakout-mode="default"}}
{{layout-cell}}
{{info}}
=== {{id name="DEMOSpace-Welcometoyournewknowledgebasespace"/}}**Welcome to your new knowledge base space** ===

A knowledge base is a shared resource that your whole team can use and contribute to.

Use it to build a wiki, create content to deflect help-desk requests, or for anything else where you want to quickly create lots of pages without worrying about organization and structure.

**To start, you might want to:**

* **Customise this overview **using the **edit icon **at the top right of this page.
* **Create a new page **by clicking the **+ **in the space sidebar.

**Tip: **Make it easier for your team to find what they're looking for by adding [[labels >>url:https://confluence.atlassian.com/confcloud/use-labels-to-organize-your-content-724764874.html||shape="rect"]]to your pages so they appear when you  **Browse by topic **below

@ste
{{/info}}

(% style="text-align: center;" %)
== {{id name="DEMOSpace-Searchthisspace"/}}Search this space ==

{{locationSearch showExcerpts="false"/}}

----
{{/layout-cell}}
{{/layout-section}}

{{layout-section ac:type="two_equal" ac:breakout-mode="default"}}
{{layout-cell}}
== {{id name="DEMOSpace-Frequentlyusedarticles"/}}Frequently used articles ==

* Add links to popular how-to and troubleshooting articles.
* Highlight important documentation.
{{/layout-cell}}

{{layout-cell}}
== {{id name="DEMOSpace-Needmorehelp?"/}}Need more help? ==

* Link to resources such as your service desk, questions and answers or a forum.
* List contacts for getting additional help.
{{/layout-cell}}
{{/layout-section}}

{{layout-section ac:type="fixed-width" ac:breakout-mode="default"}}
{{layout-cell}}
----

== {{id name="DEMOSpace-Browsebytopic"/}}Browse by topic ==

{{listlabels/}}

{{info}}
====== {{id name="DEMOSpace-NEEDINSPIRATION?"/}}NEED INSPIRATION? ======

* Check out this guide on how to [[use Confluence as a Knowledge base>>url:https://confluence.atlassian.com/confcloud/use-confluence-as-a-knowledge-base-724765471.html||shape="rect"]]
* Follow [[Twitter's 5 tips for a successful knowledge base>>url:https://www.atlassian.com/blog/confluence/twitters-5-tips-successful-knowledge-base||shape="rect"]]
{{/info}}
{{/layout-cell}}
{{/layout-section}}
{{/layout}}</string>
