                <entry>
                  <string>title</string>
                  <string>Troubleshooting article</string>
                </entry>
                <entry>
                  <string>content</string>
                  <string>== {{id name="Troubleshootingarticle-🔵️Problem"/}}🔵️ Problem ==

Add a short description of the problem.

new update here.

== {{id name="Troubleshootingarticle-🔵️Solution"/}}🔵️ Solution ==

Describe how someone would solve the problem in a short, step-by-step guide:

(% start="1" %)
1. Add steps that are simple and self-contained
1. Add illustrations to instructions by typing /image
1. Stick to 3-5 steps per task to avoid overloading readers

{{info}}
Highlight important information in a panel like this one. To edit this panel's color or style, select one of the options in the menu.
{{/info}}

== {{id name="Troubleshootingarticle-🔵️Relatedarticles"/}}🔵️ Related articles ==

The content by label feature automatically displays related articles based on labels you choose. To edit options for this feature, select the placeholder and tap the pencil icon.</string>
                </entry>
