    <wikiSpace name="Note, tip, info, success, warning, error">
      <wikiDocument name="WebHome">
        <wikiDocumentLocale>
          <p>
            <parameters>
              <entry>
                <string>creation_author</string>
                <string>XWiki.5be2ea7a421c5f44fc455eec</string>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <string>creation_date</string>
                <date>2023-02-04 09:52:42.754 UTC</date>
              </entry>
              <entry>
                <string>lastrevision</string>
                <string>1</string>
              </entry>
            </parameters>
          </p>
          <wikiDocumentRevision revision="1">
            <p>
              <parameters>
                <entry>
                  <string>revision_author</string>
                  <string>XWiki.5be2ea7a421c5f44fc455eec</string>
                </entry>
                <entry>
                  <string>revision_date</string>
                  <date>2023-02-04 09:52:59.374 UTC</date>
                </entry>
                <entry>
                  <string>title</string>
                  <string>Note, tip, info, success, warning, error</string>
                </entry>
                <entry>
                  <string>content</string>
                  <string>Default

{{info}}
This is a note (woaw) 😯
{{/info}}

{{info}}
This is a success (yay!) 😃
{{/info}}

{{info}}
This is a warning (ohlala) 😳
{{/info}}

{{error}}
This is an error (nooooo) 🙅
{{/error}}

{{info}}
This is an info (indeed) 👀
{{/info}}

With smiley

{{panel panelIcon=":innocent:" panelIconId="1f607" panelIconText="😇" bgColor="#EAE6FF"}}
A note, again
{{/panel}}

{{panel panelIcon=":thumbsup:" panelIconId="1f44d" panelIconText="👍" bgColor="#E3FCEF"}}
A tip, again
{{/panel}}

{{panel panelIcon=":grimacing:" panelIconId="1f62c" panelIconText="😬" bgColor="#FFFAE6"}}
A warning, again
{{/panel}}

{{panel panelIcon=":face_with_symbols_over_mouth:" panelIconId="1f92c" panelIconText="🤬" bgColor="#FFEBE6"}}
An error, again
{{/panel}}

{{panel panelIcon=":slight_smile:" panelIconId="1f642" panelIconText="🙂" bgColor="#DEEBFF"}}
An info, again
{{/panel}}

Without icon

{{panel bgColor="#EAE6FF"}}
No note icon for you :(
{{/panel}}

{{panel bgColor="#E3FCEF"}}
No tip icon for you :(
{{/panel}}

{{panel bgColor="#FFFAE6"}}
No warning icon for you :(
{{/panel}}

{{panel bgColor="#FFEBE6"}}
No error icon for you :(
{{/panel}}

{{panel bgColor="#DEEBFF"}}
No info icon for you :(
{{/panel}}

With color

{{panel panelIcon=":note:" panelIconId="atlassian-note" bgColor="#998DD9"}}
Note: The color is different OMG
{{/panel}}

{{panel panelIcon=":check_mark:" panelIconId="atlassian-check_mark" bgColor="#57D9A3"}}
Tip: The color is different OMG
{{/panel}}

{{panel panelIcon=":warning:" panelIconId="atlassian-warning" bgColor="#FFC400"}}
Warning: The color is different OMG
{{/panel}}

{{panel panelIcon=":cross_mark:" panelIconId="atlassian-cross_mark" bgColor="#FF8F73"}}
Error: The color is different OMG
{{/panel}}

{{panel panelIcon=":info:" panelIconId="atlassian-info" bgColor="#4C9AFF"}}
Info: The color is different OMG
{{/panel}}

Panel macro

{{panel panelIcon=":rainbow:" panelIconId="1f308" panelIconText="🌈" bgColor="#E6FCFF"}}
Custom panel that might have nothing to do with the rest? 🤔
{{/panel}}

{{panel bgColor="#E6FCFF"}}
No emoji for you! :(
{{/panel}}

{{panel panelIcon=":eyes:" panelIconId="1f440" panelIconText="👀" bgColor="#B3BAC5"}}
the color is grey
{{/panel}}

Trying to put a title but there is no title parameter available in confluence cloud so I use an h4

{{info}}
==== {{id name="Note,tip,info,success,warning,error-TitleH4"/}}Title H4 ====

and some content
{{/info}}

{{info}}
==== {{id name="Note,tip,info,success,warning,error-Thisisasuccess!"/}}This is a success! ====

And indeed there is some content here too woaw
{{/info}}</string>
                </entry>
                <entry>
                  <string>syntax</string>
                  <org.xwiki.rendering.syntax.Syntax>
                    <type>
                      <name>XWiki</name>
                      <id>xwiki</id>
                      <variants class="empty-list"/>
                    </type>
                    <version>2.1</version>
                  </org.xwiki.rendering.syntax.Syntax>
                </entry>
              </parameters>
            </p>
          </wikiDocumentRevision>
        </wikiDocumentLocale>
      </wikiDocument>
    </wikiSpace>
