      <wikiSpace name="Latex Math Inline">
        <wikiDocument name="WebHome">
          <wikiDocumentLocale>
            <p>
              <parameters>
                <entry>
                  <string>creation_author</string>
                  <string>XWiki.5be2ea7a421c5f44fc455eec</string>
                </entry>
                <entry>
                  <string>creation_date</string>
                  <date>2024-05-30 09:31:38.226 UTC</date>
                </entry>
                <entry>
                  <string>lastrevision</string>
                  <string>1</string>
                </entry>
              </parameters>
            </p>
            <wikiDocumentRevision revision="1">
              <p>
                <parameters>
                  <entry>
                    <string>revision_author</string>
                    <string>XWiki.5be2ea7a421c5f44fc455eec</string>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <string>revision_date</string>
                    <date>2024-05-30 09:31:38.226 UTC</date>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <string>title</string>
                    <string>Latex Math Inline</string>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <string>content</string>
                    <string>Macro allowing to insert latex in Confluence and render it.

E=mc2

{{mathjax}}
\(E = mc^2\)
{{/mathjax}}

[[image:attach:image-20210720-141740.png||original-height="24" data-xwiki-image-style-alignment="center" original-width="62"]]

Pi

{{mathjax}}
\(\pi = \frac c d\)
{{/mathjax}}

[[image:attach:image-20210720-141847.png||original-height="24" data-xwiki-image-style-alignment="center" original-width="45"]]

Function with limit

{{mathjax}}
\(e = \lim_{x\rightarrow\infty} \left(1+\frac{1}{n}\right)^n\)
{{/mathjax}}

Function with limit

{{mathjax}}
\(e = \lim_{x\to\infty} \left(1+\dfrac{1}{n}\right)^n\)
{{/mathjax}}

[[image:attach:image-20210720-141549.png||original-height="43" data-xwiki-image-style-alignment="center" original-width="165"]]

Fraction

{{mathjax}}
\(\frac{a + b}{2}\)
{{/mathjax}}

[[image:attach:image-20210720-141801.png||original-height="29" data-xwiki-image-style-alignment="center" original-width="48"]]

Matrix

{{mathjax}}
\(\begin{matrix} a &amp; b &amp; c \\ d &amp; e &amp; f \\ g &amp; h &amp; i \end{matrix}\)
{{/mathjax}}

Function

{{mathjax}}
\(\begin{align*} f(x) &amp;= (x+a)(x+b) \\ &amp;= x^2 + (a+b)x + ab \end{align*}\)
{{/mathjax}}

[[image:attach:image-20210720-141929.png||original-height="43" data-xwiki-image-style-alignment="center" original-width="186"]]

AsciiMath

{{mathjax}}
\(sum_(i=1)^n i^3=((n(n+1))/2)^2\)
{{/mathjax}}</string>
                  </entry>
                  <entry>
                    <string>syntax</string>
                    <org.xwiki.rendering.syntax.Syntax>
                      <type>
                        <name>XWiki</name>
                        <id>xwiki</id>
                        <variants class="empty-list"/>
                      </type>
                      <version>2.1</version>
                    </org.xwiki.rendering.syntax.Syntax>
                  </entry>
                </parameters>
              </p>
